  unitName: Spear Arms Raydn
  unitId: 20354
  unitNumber: 504
  description: The cool-headed Guardian with superior spear wielding skills who chased
    after the traitors. Not even word of Sodis' betrayal stirred him as he then proceeded
    to investigate his movements, guessing at why he might've rebelled. Once he received
    instructions from the gods via his good friend to track down and vanquish the
    traitors, without hesitation he joined the fight against them. Though he held
    much doubt in his heart, he couldn't help but assist his dear friend.
  summonDesc: There's no need to say anything.<br>I know what you want to say.<br>Let
    us be on our way.
  fusionDesc: I'm grateful for your deed.<br>I'd like to return the favor so please<br>command
    me as you wish.
  evoDesc: I refuse to brag about my power.<br>However, I am still confident in it.<br>I've
    put in a lot of effort.
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
